Racing is optional. Members race citizen events across the Midwest at every level, and members who skip the start line are just as much a part of race weekend: the Techno Corner cheering section shows up at most big races.

Some skiers are there to finish and some are there to win. Either way, TCSC teammates line the trail.

In 2026, TCSC had over 80 skiers at the American Birkebeiner, in both the Birkebeiner and Kortelopet events. For some it was their first-ever race, while others placed in the Top 20, and TCSC had skiers in every wave, from Elite to Wave 8.

For races that involve travel, TCSC helps organize food, transportation, and lodging for regional weekend events (additional racing fees not included in the seasonal fee). Members also have the option to purchase custom TCSC race suits.
